      "end": 749,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Language assessment\nLanguage assessment or language testing is a field of study under the umbrella of applied linguistics . Its main focus is the assessment of first , second or other language in the school , college , or university context ; assessment of language use in the workplace ; and assessment of language in the immigration , citizenship , and asylum contexts . The assessment may include listening , speaking , reading , writing , an integration of two or more of these skills , or other constructs of language ability . Equal weight may be placed on knowledge ( understanding how the language works theoretically ) and proficiency ( ability to use the language practically ) , or greater weight may be given to one aspect or the other ."
